    "b1": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "• GLM became a gateway, not a harness: moved into the LLM gateway registry (#990) with tiered model mapping (#998). cursor + hermes harnesses landed earlier in the window (#967)",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "b2": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "• fail-closed everything: envelope fails hard on bad adapter output (#987), hermes fails on api errors (#984), xai search retries transients (#989)",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "b3": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "• the repair loop got more honest: no more marking an issue resolved when the fix PR is merely opened (#997). self-repair is the moat — but only if it tells the truth",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "b4": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "• telegram reply-to-previous-run (#995) + dashboard origin-host pinning (#986)",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "b5": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "• 3 third-party skill packs registered (Spoolis, CultOS, Farcaster) — the pack registry is becoming a real ecosystem surface",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "b6": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "• the fleet fought its own outage: gateway died sunday, 7 skills down, diagnosed + pinned + regression caught same day, all on public traces. cron is trivial until it isn't — then self-repair earns the name",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "b7": {
      "type": "Alert",
      "props": {
        "title": "security",
        "message": "6 CVE dep-fix PRs filed into pytorch, vscode, workerd, NVIDIA/OpenShell, browser-use, cursor/plugins. 0 merged yet. big repos move slow",
        "type": "warning"
      }
    },
    "b8": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "• the websites got ~50 PRs (LCP rounds, Copy-for-LLM, star pill) + a new founder hub (13 PRs in 36h) + founder credit swept across 22 repos",
        "variant": "body"
      }
    },
    "b9": {
